(18: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: We%20should%20allow%20to%20easily%20develop%20grammars%20inherited%20from%20meta-language%2C%20by%20using%20grammar%20inference%20%28find%20patterns%20in%20examples%20of%20texts%20of%20that%20grammar%29.%0A%0AIdeally%20it%20should%20be%20possible%20to%20reconstruct%20programming%20language%20grammar%20by%20using%20only%20examples%20of%20correct%20programming%20language%20texts.%0A%0AWe%20also%20need%20to%20make%20sure%20we%20use%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-notation%20as%20a%20basis%20for%20our%20meta-language.%20And%20our%20meta%20language%20itself%20is%20inherited%20from%20meta-notation.%0A%0ASo%20when%20constructing%20new%20grammars%20in%20meta-language%20ecosystem%2C%20it%20should%20be%20possible%20to%20have%20maximum%20freedom%20of%20grammar%20inference.%0A%0ASearch%20online%20best%20papers%20on%20the%20topic%20of%20grammar%20inference%2C%20and%20we%20need%20to%20have%20working%20rust%20implementation%2C%20that%20is%20able%20to%20generate%20grammar%20description%20in%20the%20meta-language%20itself%2C%20which%20after%20that%20we%20should%20be%20able%20to%20translate%20to%20rust%2C%20javascript%20and%20other%20languages%20%28we%20also%20should%20include%20of%20PEG%2C%20BNF%20and%20other%20languages%2C%20to%20be%20parsed%20as%20meta%20language%29.%0A%0ANote%20that%20meta%20language%20has%20shared%20concepts%20between%20all%20the%20languages%2C%20so%20if%20the%20concept%20is%20exactly%20the%20same%20in%20both%20of%20formal%20or%20natural%20languages%2C%20it%20will%20be%20possible%20to%20translate%20it%201%20to%201%20with%20little%20code%20modification%20or%20extension.%0A%0AWe%20need%20to%20plan%20as%20much%20issues%20as%20possible%20to%20make%20sure%20our%20system%20fully%20implements%20everything%2C%20beats%20all%20the%20competitors%20in%20all%20metrics.%0A%0AWe%20need%20to%20collect%20data%20related%20about%20the%20issue%20to%20this%20repository%2C%20make%20sure%20we%20compile%20that%20data%20to%20%60.%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-%7Bid%7D%60%20folder%2C%20and%20use%20it%20to%20do%20deep%20case%20study%20analysis%20%28also%20make%20sure%20to%20search%20online%20for%20additional%20facts%20and%20data%29%2C%20list%20of%20each%20and%20all%20requirements%20from%20the%20issue%2C%20and%20propose%20possible%20solutions%20and%20solution%20plans%20for%20each%20requirement%20%28we%20should%20also%20check%20known%20existing%20components%2Flibraries%2C%20that%20solve%20similar%20problem%20or%20can%20help%20in%20solutions%29.%0A%0AYou%20have%20unlimited%20time%20and%20context%2C%20as%20context%20auto-compacts%20and%20you%20can%20continue%20indefinitely%2C%20until%20everything%20is%20totally%20planned%20as%20issues%20in%20this%20repository.%0A%0AMake%20sure%20all%20issues%20are%20sub-issues%20of%20this%20issue%2C%20and%20have%20properly%20configured%20blocked%20by%20relationships%20using%20gh%20tool%2C%20to%20make%20dependencies%20between%20issues%20visible.%0A%0AEach%20issue%20should%20be%20maximum%20detailed%20possible%2C%20so%20even%20week%20AI%20agent%20will%20be%20able%20to%20complete%20it.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
